            <ArticleTitle>[Renal leiomyoma. Case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>407-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a case of renal leiomyoma observed in a 56-year-old man. This cyst presented in the from of loin pain. Computed tomography revealed a homogeneous renal tumor. Treatment consisted of radical nephrectomy. Histological examination of the specimen showed benign renal leiomyoma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
